<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT LEICESTER/NORTHAMPTON XV 33-20.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT LEICESTER/NORTHAMPTON XV 33-20.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat a</p>
<p>Leicester/Northampton select XV 33-20 (halftime 20-6) in their</p>
<p>rugby union tour match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Leicester/Northampton - Tries: Penalty try, Hearn.</p>
<p>Conversions: Malone (2). Penalties: Malone (2)</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Feaunati, Fanolua, Lam, Ta'ala,</p>
<p>Toala. Conversion: Tanoai. Penalties: Tanoai.</p>
</text>
